  stampState: 0
  description: 'Our nation is still facing serious energy shortages.  <br>The Nuclear
    Energy Project could solve a large part of our energy crisis, but it would come
    with significant costs: <br> $6 billion from the national budget <br>2 building
    spaces <br> -15% environmental health  <br>-15% relations with neighboring countries
    if the plant is built near their borders <br> 1 unit of uranium '
  approvalGains: 'However, the project would also provide:<br> +20% public approval
    during elections '
  denyGains: If we reject this project:<br> -10% public approval <br> +5% relations
    with neighboring countries
  approvalCosts: 140000000f00000000000000faffffff0000000001000000020000000200000002000000
